---
interface Props {
  /** `compare` puts the two spellings side by side. `keys` shows one key sequence under both styles. */
  variant?: 'compare' | 'keys';
}

const { variant = 'compare' } = Astro.props;
const isKeys = variant === 'keys';

/** Each word is split around the letter that carries the tone, so it can be highlighted. */
const pairs = [
  { traditional: ['h', 'ò', 'a'], modern: ['ho', 'à', ''] },
  { traditional: ['kh', 'ỏ', 'e'], modern: ['kho', 'ẻ', ''] },
  { traditional: ['th', 'ủ', 'y'], modern: ['thu', 'ỷ', ''] },
];
---

{isKeys ? (
  <figure
    class="tone-example"
    aria-label="Gõ hoaf rồi dấu cách: kiểu truyền thống ra hòa, kiểu hiện đại ra hoà"
  >
    <div class="example-heading">
      <span>GÕ MỘT LẦN, DẤU TỰ VÀO CHỖ</span>
      <span aria-hidden="true">✳</span>
    </div>
    <div class="example-flow">
      <div class="example-input">
        <span class="example-label">BẠN GÕ (TELEX)</span>
        <div class="example-keys">
          <kbd>h</kbd>
          <kbd>o</kbd>
          <kbd>a</kbd>
          <kbd class="tone-key">
            f<span class="sr-only">, phím dấu huyền</span>
          </kbd>
          <span>+</span>
          <kbd>Space</kbd>
        </div>
      </div>
      <span class="example-arrow" aria-hidden="true">
        →
      </span>
      <div class="example-output">
        <div class="output-row">
          <span class="example-label">TRUYỀN THỐNG</span>
          <p>
            h<span class="tone">ò</span>a
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="output-row">
          <span class="example-label">HIỆN ĐẠI</span>
          <p>
            ho<span class="tone">à</span>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <figcaption>
      Telex hofa hay VNI hoa2 cũng ra cùng kết quả. Bạn giữ thói quen gõ, Funput đặt dấu theo kiểu
      đã chọn.
    </figcaption>
  </figure>
) : (
  <figure
    class="tone-example"
    aria-label="So sánh kiểu cũ hòa, khỏe, thủy với kiểu mới hoà, khoẻ, thuỷ"
  >
    <div class="example-heading">
      <span>CÙNG MỘT TỪ, HAI CÁCH ĐẶT DẤU</span>
      <span aria-hidden="true">✳</span>
    </div>
    <div class="compare-grid">
      <div class="compare-column">
        <span class="example-label">KIỂU CŨ · TRUYỀN THỐNG</span>
        <ul>
          {pairs.map(({ traditional: [before, toned, after] }) => (
            <li>
              {before}
              <span class="tone">{toned}</span>
              {after}
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="compare-column modern">
        <span class="example-label">KIỂU MỚI · HIỆN ĐẠI</span>
        <ul>
          {pairs.map(({ modern: [before, toned, after] }) => (
            <li>
              {before}
              <span class="tone">{toned}</span>
              {after}
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <figcaption>
      Chữ tô màu là chữ mang dấu thanh. Hai kiểu chỉ khác nhau ở vần oa, oe, uy khi sau đó không có
      phụ âm cuối.
    </figcaption>
  </figure>
)}

<style>
  .tone-example {
    margin-block: 32px;
    padding: 28px;
    border: 1px solid #cbd4bd;
    border-radius: 16px;
    background: var(--sage);
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .example-heading {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 16px;
    padding-bottom: 22px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #cbd4bd;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
  }
  .example-heading > :last-child {
    color: #ba3919;
    font-size: 32px;
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .example-label {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    color: #535d46;
    font-size: 9px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
  }
  .tone {
    color: #ba3919;
  }
  .compare-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 18px;
    padding-block: 28px;
  }
  .compare-column {
    padding: 20px 22px;
    border: 1px solid #c5cbb9;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: #fffcf4;
  }
  .compare-column.modern {
    border-color: var(--ink);
  }
  .compare-column ul {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 6px 22px;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }
  .compare-column li {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    font-size: clamp(22px, 3vw, 30px);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.8px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .compare-column li::marker {
    content: none;
  }
  .example-flow {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.6fr) auto minmax(0, 1fr);
    align-items: center;
    gap: 24px;
    padding-block: 28px;
  }
  .example-keys {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 7px;
  }
  kbd {
    padding: 5px 12px;
    border: 1px solid #c5cbb9;
    border-bottom-width: 3px;
    border-radius: 7px;
    background: #fffcf4;
    font-family: inherit;
    font-size: 15px;
  }
  kbd.tone-key {
    border-color: #ba3919;
    color: #ba3919;
  }
  .example-keys > span {
    color: #535d46;
    font-size: 12px;
  }
  .example-arrow {
    color: #ba3919;
    font-size: 28px;
  }
  .example-output {
    display: grid;
    gap: 14px;
  }
  .output-row .example-label {
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .example-output p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(22px, 3vw, 30px);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.8px;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  .tone-example figcaption {
    margin: 0;
    padding-top: 18px;
    border-top: 1px solid #cbd4bd;
    color: #535d46;
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
  .sr-only {
    position: absolute;
    width: 1px;
    height: 1px;
    padding: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);
    white-space: nowrap;
    border: 0;
  }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .tone-example {
      padding: 22px;
    }
    .compare-grid,
    .example-flow {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: 16px;
    }
    .example-arrow {
      justify-self: start;
      transform: rotate(90deg);
      line-height: 1;
    }
  }
</style>
